---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";
import InstituteGrid from "../components/InstituteGrid.astro";
import ResourceGrid from "../components/ResourceGrid.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About SAL Education" description="Learn about SAL Education, its Ahmedabad campus, institutes, governance and academic direction.">
  <PageIntro number="01" label="ABOUT SAL" eyebrow="Ideas grow here" title="Learn with purpose.<br><em>Lead with possibility.</em>" lead="SAL Education brings a range of academic institutes together on one campus in Ahmedabad. The campus offers programs across engineering, management, pharmacy, architecture, design, computer applications and medical sciences." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container story-columns"><div><span class="eyebrow">Empowering minds, shaping futures</span><h2>A connected campus<br><em>for curious minds.</em></h2></div><div class="long-copy"><p>SAL Education describes its aim as nurturing innovative, skilled and responsible graduates through expert faculty, facilities and industry-aligned programs. Its institutes offer students pathways to build specialist knowledge and practical skills.</p><p>The main SAL site refers to a group of seven institutes, while the institute navigation and course catalog list ten institute and school destinations. This redesign names each destination directly so prospective students can compare programs without relying on a conflicting total.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://sal.edu.in/vision-mission-objectives" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read SAL’s vision, mission &amp; objectives <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section institutes-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head compact-head"><div><div class="section-label"><span>02</span><span class="label-rule"></span><span>INSTITUTES</span></div><span class="eyebrow">Specialist communities</span><h2>Explore the <em>campus.</em></h2></div><p class="section-head-aside">Open an institute page for program information and the official institute website.</p></div><InstituteGrid /></div></section>
  <section class="section resource-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-label"><span>03</span><span class="label-rule"></span><span>LEADERSHIP &amp; GOVERNANCE</span></div><span class="eyebrow">Official resources</span><h2>How SAL is <em>guided.</em></h2></div><div class="section-head-aside"><p>Messages, recognition and governance documents remain linked to the official SAL resources.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/">Open resource library <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><ResourceGrid section="About SAL" /><ResourceGrid section="Governance" /></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
